<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
  td, th { padding: 4px 0; text-align: left; }
  .form-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .form-group { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .label { font-weight: bold; }
  .input-area { border-bottom: 1px solid black; min-width: 150px; }
  .header-section { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .header-box { width: 45%; }
  .right-column { width: 50%; }
  .section-title { font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-section">
    <div class="header-box">
      <div style="font-size: 12px;">
        <span data-field="status_indicator_1">{{ status_indicator_1 }}</span> <span data-field="status_indicator_2">{{ status_indicator_2 }}</span> <span data-field="status_indicator_3">{{ status_indicator_3 }}</span>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
        <div style="font-size: 10px;">
          <span data-field="field_label_1">{{ field_label_1 }}</span>
          <span data-field="field_label_2">{{ field_label_2 }}</span>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
          <span data-field="input_area_1" style="display: inline-block; width: 60%;">{{ input_area_1 }}</span>
          <span data-field="input_area_2" style="display: inline-block; width: 10%;">{{ input_area_2 }}</span>
          <span data-field="input_area_3" style="display: inline-block; width: 20%;">{{ input_area_3 }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="right-column">
      <div style="text-align: right;">
        <div style="font-size: 12px;">
          <span data-field="omb_no">{{ omb_no }}</span>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
          <div style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;">Cancellation of Debt</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <table style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 25%;">
        <div style="font-size: 12px;">
          <span data-field="creditor_id_label">{{ creditor_id_label }}</span>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 5px;"><span data-field="creditor_id_input" class="input-area">{{ creditor_id_input }}</span></div>
      </td>
      <td style="width: 25%;">
        <div style="font-size: 12px;">
          <span data-field="debtor_id_label">{{ debtor_id_label }}</span>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 5px;"><span data-field="debtor_id_input" class="input-area">{{ debtor_id_input }}</span></div>
      </td>
      <td style="width: 50%;">
        <div style="font-size: 12px;">
          <span data-field="description_label">{{ description_label }}</span>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 5px;"><span data-field="description_input" class="input-area">{{ description_input }}</span></div>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 25%;">
        <div style="font-size: 12px;">
          <span data-field="debtor_name_label">{{ debtor_name_label }}</span>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 5px;"><span data-field="debtor_name_input" class="input-area">{{ debtor_name_input }}</span></div>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 75%; display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
        <div style="flex-grow: 1;">
          <div style="font-size: 12px;">
            <span data-field="street_address_label">{{ street_address_label }}</span>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top: 5px;"><span data-field="street_address_input" class="input-area">{{ street_address_input }}</span></div>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 20%; text-align: right;">
          <div style="font-size: 12px;">
            <span data-field="check_box_label">{{ check_box_label }}</span>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
            <span data-field="check_box_input" style="display: inline-block; width: 15px; height: 15px; border: 1px solid black;">{{ check_box_input }}</span>
            <span style="margin-left: 5px;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 25%;">
        <div style="font-size: 12px;">
          <span data-field="city_state_zip_label">{{ city_state_zip_label }}</span>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 5px;"><span data-field="city_state_zip_input" class="input-area">{{ city_state_zip_input }}</span></div>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 75%; display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
        <div style="flex-grow: 1;">
          <div style="font-size: 12px;">
            <span data-field="account_number_label">{{ account_number_label }}</span>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top: 5px;"><span data-field="account_number_input" class="input-area">{{ account_number_input }}</span></div>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 20%; text-align: right;">
          <div style="font-size: 12px;">
            <span data-field="event_code_label">{{ event_code_label }}</span>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top: 5px;"><span data-field="event_code_input" class="input-area">{{ event_code_input }}</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 25%;">
        <div style="font-size: 12px;">
          <span data-field="form_number_label">{{ form_number_label }}</span>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 5px;"><span data-field="form_number_input" class="input-area">{{ form_number_input }}</span></div>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 75%; display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
        <div style="flex-grow: 1;">
          <div style="font-size: 12px;">
            <span data-field="website_url">{{ website_url }}</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 20%; text-align: right;">
          <div style="font-size: 12px;">
            <span data-field="treasury_dept">{{ treasury_dept }}</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px;">
    <div style="font-weight: bold;">Do Not Cut or Separate Forms on This Page — Do Not Cut or Separate Forms on This Page</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="padding-top: 20px;">
    <div style="font-size: 12px;">
      <span data-field="instructions_title">{{ instructions_title }}</span>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <p style="margin: 0;">General and specific form instructions are provided separately. You should use the 2013 General Instructions for Certain Information Returns and the 2013 Instructions for Forms 1099-A and 1099-C to complete Form 1099-C. A chart in the general instructions provides a guide to what information must be filed to report a particular payment. To order these instructions and additional forms, go to <span data-field="irs_website_instructions">{{ irs_website_instructions }}</span> or call 1-800-TAX-FORM (1-800-829-3676).</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="padding-top: 20px;">
    <div style="font-size: 12px;">
      <span data-field="instructions_title_2">{{ instructions_title_2 }}</span>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <p style="margin: 0;">File a copy of this form with the IRS by February 28, 2014. If you file electronically, the due date is March 31, 2014. To file electronically, you must have software that generates a file according to the specifications in Pub. 1220, Specifications for Filing Forms 1099, 1098, 1099-MISC, and 1099-NEC. The IRS does not provide a file-in-form option.</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 10px;">Need help? If you have questions about reporting on Form 1099-C, call the information reporting customer service toll free at 1-866-455-7348 or 304-263-8700 (TTY 1-800-829-1040). For questions about the form, disability with access to TTY/TDD equipment can call 304-579-4827 (not toll free). The hours of operation are Monday through Friday from 8:30 a.m. to 4:30 p.m., Eastern time.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>